{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29584","headline":"楚宫 · 李商隐","name":"楚宫","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"湘波如泪色漻缪，楚厉迷魂逐恨遥。\n枫树夜猿愁自断，女萝山鬼语相邀。\n空归腐败犹难复，更困腥臊岂易招。\n但使故乡三户在，彩丝谁惜惧长蛟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}